<section class="section" id="studio"><div class="container"><div class="row align-items-end mb-5"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="label text-success mb-2">AI Design Studio</div><h2 class="display-5">Talk to the architect. Don't fill out a form.</h2><p class="lead-copy mt-3">The AI remembers what you already told it. If you say “6”, it uses the previous question and understands what that number refers to. If your brief conflicts with itself, it explains the conflict instead of looping.</p></div></div><div class="studio"><div class="studio-head"><div><h3 class="mb-1">Architectural conversation</h3><div class="muted" style="font-size:12px">Requirements → constrained plan → human edits → 3D</div></div><a class="tool" href="map.php">🗺 GIS / Map</a></div><div class="studio-grid"><section class="chat"><div class="chat-top"><div class="chat-status">● AI architect online</div><div class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:5px">Speak naturally. Swahili or English.</div></div><div id="messages" class="messages"><div class="msg ai">Hello. Tell me the house you want to design. I will listen to the whole conversation and only ask for information that is genuinely missing.</div><div class="msg system">For example: “Nataka nyumba ya kisasa ya vyumba vitano kwenye plot ya 20 × 30m, sebule kubwa katikati, bedrooms zizunguke sebule, courtyard, kitchen, dining, pantry, toilets, veranda na parking.”</div></div><div class="chat-compose"><textarea id="chatInput" placeholder="Andika mahitaji ya nyumba…"></textarea><button id="sendBtn" class="send">➤</button></div></section><section class="workspace"><div class="workspace-bar"><button class="tool active" data-view="plan">2D PLAN</button><button class="tool" data-view="three">3D MODEL</button><button class="tool" id="generateBtn">GENERATE</button><button class="tool" id="resetBtn">RESET AI PLAN</button><span id="workspaceStatus" class="workspace-status">Waiting for requirements…</span></div><div id="planView" class="view active"><div class="plan-wrap"><div id="planBoard" class="plan-board"><div class="site-boundary"></div><div id="emptyPlan" class="empty-state">The plan will appear here after the AI confirms the brief.<br>You will be able to drag, resize, rename and remove spaces.</div></div></div><div id="inspector" class="inspector" style="display:none"><div class="field name"><label>Space</label><input id="roomName"></div><div class="field"><label>Width m</label><input id="roomW" type="number" step="0.1"></div><div class="field"><label>Depth m</label><input id="roomD" type="number" step="0.1"></div><button class="tool" id="applyEdit">APPLY</button><button class="tool" id="deleteRoom">DELETE</button><div class="inspector-note">Drag a space to move it. Pull the green corner to resize it.</div></div></div><div id="threeView" class="view"><div class="three"><div id="threeRoot"></div><div class="three-hint">Drag to orbit · wheel to zoom</div><div class="three-tools"><button id="threeTop">TOP</button><button id="threeIso">ISOMETRIC</button><button id="threeFront">FRONT</button></div></div></div></section></div><div id="summary" class="summary" style="display:none"><div class="container"><div class="row g-4" id="summaryInner"></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section pt-0" id="how"><div class="container"><div class="label text-success mb-2">The design loop</div><h2 class="display-5 mb-5">A serious human–AI workflow.</h2><div class="row g-0 process"><div class="col-md-3"><div class="process-item pe-md-4"><div class="process-num">01 · LISTEN</div><h4>Conversation</h4><p class="muted">Describe the architecture in normal language. The AI keeps the context instead of resetting the interview.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-3"><div class="process-item px-md-4"><div class="process-num">02 · CLARIFY</div><h4>Missing information</h4><p class="muted">Plot dimensions, room counts and critical relationships are clarified progressively. No repeated question after an answer.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-3"><div class="process-item px-md-4"><div class="process-num">03 · EDIT</div><h4>Human control</h4><p class="muted">Move spaces, change dimensions, rename or delete them. The human-approved geometry becomes the current plan.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-3"><div class="process-item ps-md-4"><div class="process-num">04 · VISUALIZE</div><h4>2D → 3D</h4><p class="muted">The 3D view is regenerated from the same edited room geometry rather than being a separate illustration.</p></div></div></div></div></section><footer><div class="container d-flex justify-content-between gap-4 flex-wrap"><div><strong>RAMANI MAJENGO</strong><div class="mt-2" style="font-size:12px;color:#aeb8ad">AI architecture · GIS · spatial design</div></div><div style="font-size:12px;color:#aeb8ad;max-width:540px">Conceptual planning and visualization. Final construction drawings, structural calculations, site boundaries and statutory approvals require review by qualified local professionals.</div></div></footer><a class="floating-map" href="map.php">🗺 GIS / Map</a><div id="loading" class="loading"><div class="loading-inner"><strong id="loadingTitle">AI is thinking…</strong><div style="font-size:12px;color:#cbd2c9;margin-top:8px">Reading the complete conversation and preserving your requirements.</div><div class="loading-line"><i></i></div></div></div><script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script><script type="importmap">{"imports":{"three":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/build/three.module.js","three/addons/":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/examples/jsm/"}}</script><script type="module">
import * as THREE from 'three';import {OrbitControls} from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';const $=s=>document.querySelector(s),messages=$('#messages');let history=[],state={plot_width:null,plot_depth:null,bedrooms:null,total_spaces:null,ready:false},plan=null,selected=-1,dragging=null,resizing=null;const addMsg=(text,who='ai')=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='msg '+who;d.textContent=text;messages.appendChild(d);messages.scrollTop=messages.scrollHeight};const setLoading=v=>$('#loading').style.display=v?'flex':'none';async function sendChat(){const input=$('#chatInput'),text=input.value.trim();if(!text)return;input.value='';addMsg(text,'user');history.push({role:'user',content:text});setLoading(true);try{const res=await fetch('api/chat.php',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({conversation:history})}),j=await res.json();if(!j.ok){addMsg(j.message||'AI haikuweza kujibu kwa sasa.','ai');return}const r=j.reply||{};history.push({role:'assistant',content:r.message||''});addMsg(r.message||j.message||'Nimepokea.','ai');state={...state,...r};$('#workspaceStatus').textContent=r.ready?'Requirements complete — Generate is ready.':'AI is clarifying the brief…'}catch(e){addMsg('Kuna tatizo la mawasiliano na AI. Jaribu tena.','ai')}finally{setLoading(false)}}$('#sendBtn').onclick=sendChat;$('#chatInput').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'&&!e.shiftKey){e.preventDefault();sendChat()}});function escapeHtml(s){return String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#039;'}[c]))}function clearBoard(){document.querySelectorAll('.room').forEach(x=>x.remove())}function renderPlan(data){plan={...data,rooms:(data.rooms||[]).map((r,i)=>({...r,x:r.x??(35+(i%4)*220),y:r.y??(35+Math.floor(i/4)*170),width:+r.width||6,depth:+r.depth||5}))};clearBoard();$('#emptyPlan').style.display='none';selected=-1;plan.rooms.forEach((r,i)=>makeRoom(r,i));$('#workspaceStatus').textContent=`${plan.rooms.length} spaces · editable`;
$('#summary').style.display='block';$('#summaryInner').innerHTML=`<div class="col-md-5"><strong>${escapeHtml(plan.title||'AI architectural concept')}</strong><span>${escapeHtml(plan.summary||'Generated from the approved conversation.')}</span></div><div class="col-md-2"><strong>${plan.house_width||'—'} × ${plan.house_depth||'—'} m</strong><span>Building footprint</span></div><div class="col-md-2"><strong>${plan.rooms.filter(r=>String(r.type||'').toLowerCase()==='bedroom').length}</strong><span>Bedrooms</span></div><div class="col-md-3"><strong>${plan.rooms.filter(r=>String(r.type||'').toLowerCase()==='courtyard').length?'Courtyard included':'Open-space plan'}</strong><span>Spatial character</span></div>`;init3D();window._aiPlan=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(plan))}function makeRoom(r,i){const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='room';el.dataset.i=i;el.style.left=r.x+'px';el.style.top=r.y+'px';el.style.width=Math.max(60,r.width*35)+'px';el.style.height=Math.max(45,r.depth*35)+'px';el.innerHTML=`<div><div class="room-name">${escapeHtml(r.name)}</div><div class="room-size">${(+r.width).toFixed(1)} × ${(+r.depth).toFixed(1)} m</div></div><span class="resize"></span>`;$('#planBoard').appendChild(el);el.addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(e.target.classList.contains('resize'))resizing={i,ox:e.clientX,oy:e.clientY,w:+r.width,d:+r.depth};else{selected=i;selectRoom();dragging={i,ox:e.clientX,oy:e.clientY,x:r.x,y:r.y}}el.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);e.preventDefault()});el.addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(dragging&&dragging.i===i){r.x=Math.max(20,Math.min(900,dragging.x+(e.clientX-dragging.ox)));r.y=Math.max(20,Math.min(500,dragging.y+(e.clientY-dragging.oy)));el.style.left=r.x+'px';el.style.top=r.y+'px'}if(resizing&&resizing.i===i){r.width=Math.max(2,resizing.w+(e.clientX-resizing.ox)/35);r.depth=Math.max(2,resizing.d+(e.clientY-resizing.oy)/35);el.style.width=Math.max(60,r.width*35)+'px';el.style.height=Math.max(45,r.depth*35)+'px';el.querySelector('.room-size').textContent=`${r.width.toFixed(1)} × ${r.depth.toFixed(1)} m`}});el.addEventListener('pointerup',()=>{if(dragging||resizing)init3D();dragging=null;resizing=null})}function selectRoom(){document.querySelectorAll('.room').forEach((e,i)=>e.classList.toggle('selected',i===selected));const ins=$('#inspector');if(selected<0){ins.style.display='none';return}ins.style.display='flex';const r=plan.rooms[selected];$('#roomName').value=r.name||'';$('#roomW').value=r.width||'';$('#roomD').value=r.depth||''}$('#planBoard').addEventListener('click',e=>{const el=e.target.closest('.room');if(el){selected=+el.dataset.i;selectRoom()}});$('#applyEdit').onclick=()=>{if(selected<0)return;const r=plan.rooms[selected];r.name=$('#roomName').value.trim()||r.name;r.width=Math.max(2,+$('#roomW').value||r.width);r.depth=Math.max(2,+$('#roomD').value||r.depth);renderPlan(plan);selected=Math.min(selected,plan.rooms.length-1);selectRoom()};$('#deleteRoom').onclick=()=>{if(selected<0)return;plan.rooms.splice(selected,1);renderPlan(plan)};$('#resetBtn').onclick=()=>{if(window._aiPlan)renderPlan(window._aiPlan)};async function generate(){if(!state.plot_width||!state.plot_depth||!state.ready){addMsg('Bado kuna mahitaji muhimu ambayo AI haijathibitisha. Endelea na mazungumzo; usibonyeze Generate mpaka AI iseme requirements are complete.','ai');return}setLoading(true);$('#loadingTitle').textContent='AI is generating the architecture…';try{const fd=new FormData();fd.append('plot_width',state.plot_width);fd.append('plot_depth',state.plot_depth);fd.append('bedrooms',state.bedrooms||'');fd.append('total_spaces',state.total_spaces||'');fd.append('style',state.style||'');fd.append('brief',history.map(m=>(m.role==='user'?'USER: ':'AI: ')+m.content).join('\n'));const res=await fetch('api/generate.php',{method:'POST',body:fd}),j=await res.json();if(!j.ok){addMsg(j.message||'AI haikuweza kutengeneza plan.','ai');return}const data=j.plan||j.data||j;if(data.needs_clarification){addMsg((data.questions||[]).join('\n')||'AI inaomba clarification zaidi.','ai');return}renderPlan(data);addMsg('Plan imetengenezwa na kuthibitishwa dhidi ya mahitaji yako. Sasa unaweza kuhamisha spaces, kubadilisha dimensions, au kuendelea na 3D.','ai')}catch(e){addMsg('Kuna tatizo wakati wa kutengeneza plan. Jaribu tena.','ai')}finally{setLoading(false)}}$('#generateBtn').onclick=generate;document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));b.classList.add('active');document.querySelectorAll('.view').forEach(v=>v.classList.remove('active'));$('#'+(b.dataset.view==='plan'?'planView':'threeView')).classList.add('active');if(b.dataset.view==='three')setTimeout(()=>window._threeResize&&window._threeResize(),50)});let scene,camera,renderer,controls,modelGroup;function init3D(){if(!scene){scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color(0xdfe5df);camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45,1,.1,500);renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,powerPreference:'high-performance'});renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));renderer.shadowMap.enabled=true;renderer.shadowMap.type=THREE.PCFSoftShadowMap;$('#threeRoot').appendChild(renderer.domElement);controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);controls.enableDamping=true;scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x566255,2.8));const sun=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,3.5);sun.position.set(20,28,16);sun.castShadow=true;scene.add(sun);const fill=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xfff0d5,1.6);fill.position.set(-18,12,-12);scene.add(fill);const ground=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(120,120),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xcfd5ce,roughness:1}));ground.rotation.x=-Math.PI/2;ground.position.y=-.08;ground.receiveShadow=true;scene.add(ground);window._threeResize=resize3D;(function loop(){requestAnimationFrame(loop);controls&&controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera)})()}build3D()}function resize3D(){if(!renderer)return;const box=$('#threeRoot').getBoundingClientRect(),w=Math.max(300,box.width),h=Math.max(350,box.height);camera.aspect=w/h;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(w,h,false)}function build3D(){if(!scene||!plan)return;if(modelGroup)scene.remove(modelGroup);modelGroup=new THREE.Group();const wall=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xf2eee5,roughness:.72}),roofMat=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x30382f,roughness:.72}),glass=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x86aeb5,roughness:.2,metalness:.05,transparent:true,opacity:.72}),courtyardMat=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x8ea47e,roughness:1}),scale=.16,maxX=Math.max(...plan.rooms.map(r=>r.x+(+r.width||5)*35)),maxY=Math.max(...plan.rooms.map(r=>r.y+(+r.depth||5)*35)),ox=-maxX*scale/2,oz=-maxY*scale/2;plan.rooms.forEach(r=>{const w=Math.max(2,+r.width||5)*scale,d=Math.max(2,+r.depth||5)*scale,x=r.x*scale+ox+w/2,z=r.y*scale+oz+d/2,type=String(r.type||'').toLowerCase();if(type==='courtyard'){const yard=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w,.16,d),courtyardMat);yard.position.set(x,.02,z);modelGroup.add(yard);return}const h=3,b=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w,h,d),wall);b.position.set(x,h/2,z);b.castShadow=true;b.receiveShadow=true;modelGroup.add(b);const roof=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(w+.08,.18,d+.08),roofMat);roof.position.set(x,h+.09,z);modelGroup.add(roof);const win=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(Math.min(w*.46,2.5),1.2,.055),glass);win.position.set(x,h*.47,z+d/2+.04);modelGroup.add(win)});const slab=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(maxX*scale+1,.18,maxY*scale+1),roofMat);slab.position.y=-.09;modelGroup.add(slab);scene.add(modelGroup);resize3D();camera.position.set(Math.max(14,maxX*scale),Math.max(12,maxY*scale*.8),Math.max(16,maxY*scale*1.1));controls.target.set(0,1,0);controls.update()}$('#threeIso').onclick=()=>{camera.position.set(18,15,20);controls.target.set(0,1,0);controls.update()};$('#threeTop').onclick=()=>{camera.position.set(0,32,.01);controls.target.set(0,0,0);controls.update()};$('#threeFront').onclick=()=>{camera.position.set(0,7,30);controls.target.set(0,1,0);controls.update()};window.addEventListener('resize',()=>window._threeResize&&window._threeResize());</script></body></html>